	And I should be able to view the product with the name "Platinum Subscription" and the following values on the account details page
	| Name               | Platinum Subscription |
	| Provisioned        | 0                     |
	| Approved Purchased | 1                     |
	| State              | ACTIVE                |
	And I should be able to view the product with the name "Portal Production" and the following values on the account details page
	| Name               | Portal Production |
	| Provisioned        | 0                 |
	| Approved Purchased | 1                 |
	| State              | ACTIVE            |
	And I should be able to view the product with the name "Gold Subscription" and the following values on the account details page
	| Name               | Gold Subscription |
	| Provisioned        | 0                 |
